<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Portofolio Saya</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-sans">

  
  <header class="bg-white shadow-md fixed top-0 w-full z-10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-600">Portofolio</h1>
      <nav class="space-x-4 text-sm sm:text-base">
        <a href="#about" class="hover:text-indigo-600">Tentang</a>
        <a href="#projects" class="hover:text-indigo-600">Projek</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-indigo-600">Kontak</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  
  <section class="h-screen flex items-center justify-center text-center bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-200 to-indigo-500 text-white px-4 pt-24">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 animate-fade-in">Halo, Saya <span class="text-yellow-300">Juan Putra Omartio</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl mb-8">Saya seorang Junior Web Developer yang sedang belajar Frontend & Backend</p>
      <a href="#projects" class="bg-white text-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold shadow-md hover:bg-indigo-100 transition">Lihat Projek</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section id="about" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-6">Tentang Saya</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">Saya adalah siswa SMK 5 KOTA BEKASI yang tertarik pada pengembangan web. Saya menguasai HTML, Tailwind CSS, Express.js, Node.js , dan MySQL. Fokus saya adalah belajar menjadi developer profesional yang terus berkembang dan inovatif</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section id="projects" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-600 text-center mb-12">Projek Saya</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-2 transition">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Website CRUD Items</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Aplikasi manajemen data items menggunakan Express.js, EJS, dan MySQL.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-2 transition">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Sistem Login & Register</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Autentikasi user tanpa bcrypt, menggunakan Express dan MySQL.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-2 transition">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Kalkulator</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Website kalkulator untuk menghitung menggunakan html dan tailwind css</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section id="contact" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-6">Hubungi Saya</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 text-base sm:text-lg">Email: jpomartio08@email.com</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-base sm:text-lg">Instagram: @jujuonee</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="bg-gray-100 py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-8 text-center">Kirim Pesan ke Saya</h3>
      <form action="/user/send" method="POST"  class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-base font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2" for="name">Nama</label>
          <input type="text" id="nama" name="nama" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500" placeholder="Masukkan nama kamu" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-base font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2" for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500" placeholder="contoh@email.com" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-base font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2" for="message">Pesan</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500" placeholder="Tulis pesanmu di sini..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center pt-4">
          <button type="submit" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-indigo-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 transition">Kirim Pesan</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <footer class="bg-indigo-600 text-white text-center py-4 text-sm">
    &copy; 2025 Juan Putra Omartio. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
